## Honour Titans (Pyrrhus Command), added 2026-11-16

**Role (user ruling 2026-11-16):** bleeding-edge "sixth-generation fighter" counterparts to the [[Behemoth|Behemoths]]. They fly escort, duel and do everything the Behemoths are too big to do quickly. Pilots are addressed as "Your Honour" (after Ch12's TW-SP-HMMR "Gamma Peacekeeper" and TW-SP-CLVR "Lambda Baron").

| Parameter | Value |
|---|---|
| Height | ~60 m ("skyscraper-high"), half a Behemoth |
| Mass | heavier than most high-rise towers |
| Profile | slate-blue and gun-bronze; long reverse-jointed legs with three-clawed feet; narrow waist; broad shoulders stacked with launch racks; small wedge head with one pale visor slit; rifle in the right hand, gun-arm on the left; a white banner with a black eagle on a shoulder spar |
| Mobility | quick boosts and multi-axis rolls up to about 2,010–2,040 m/s, with pilots unbothered |
| Protection | the same 20+ layer stack as the Behemoth, in a lighter build |
| Designation | TW-SP-(weapon) "Greek letter + title" |

**Honour Lance with the 47th (twelve Titans):** TW-SP-SBRE "Theta Chancellor" (Gustav Adolf Kranichfeld) and TW-SP-GLVE "Sigma Provost" (Friedrich Nachreiner) fight at Columbus Circle. TW-SP-HLBD "Kappa Margrave" (Thomas Ludlow Huxtable), TW-SP-NGNT "Omicron Landgrave" (Kanzaki Hayato) and TW-SP-FLCN "Rho Castellan" (Pierre-Auguste Lafforgue) fly in the marsh.
